# JIP will not precompile a script with unix line endings, so git is told not to
# have an opinion about these files. core.autocrlf is "input" on this machine,
# which would quietly rewrite them on the way into a commit.
scripts-game/** -text

# The game's ini files ship with windows line endings, as almost every menu in
# this ecosystem does. core.autocrlf is "input" here, which would rewrite them
# on the way into a commit, so git is told to leave them exactly as they are.
#
# MCM json is deliberately not listed: every menu in the corpus ships it as LF.
*.ini -text
